y of MakeMyTrip for any claims shall exceed the value of the card. <\\/li>\\r\\n<li>In the event of any dispute, parties agree to exclusive jurisdiction of courts of New Delhi. <\\/li>\\r\\n<li>This is for individual use only, Travel agents found using the card would lead to cancellation of booking and no refund would be made.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\"}','[\"54\",\"118\",\"121\",\"122\",\"132\",\"207\",\"214\",\"218\",\"219\",\"271\",\"291\",\"411\"]',NULL,'false','[]','false','1 Year from the Date of Expiry',NULL,'[]',NULL,'API TESTING SIT','','a:9:{s:7:\"barcode\";a:1:{s:8:\"encoding\";s:5:\"CA128\";}s:15:\"redemptionTerms\";a:0:{}s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"clp\";s:4:\"code\";s:19:\"Test Pat eGift Card\";s:13:\"erupi_purpose\";N;s:16:\"erupi_payer_type\";N;s:16:\"erupi_payee_type\";N;s:24:\"erupi_recurrence_pattern\";N;s:14:\"erupi_validity\";N;}','a:7:{s:7:\"enabled\";b:1;s:15:\"payment_methods\";a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"svc\";}s:13:\"account_types\";a:2:{i:0;s:12:\"BANK_ACCOUNT\";i:1;s:3:\"UPI\";}s:17:\"transaction_types\";a:3:{i:0;s:4:\"IMPS\";i:1;s:4:\"NEFT\";i:2;s:3:\"UPI\";}s:21:\"maximum_beneficiaries\";s:1:\"1\";s:28:\"validate_terms_and_condition\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"validation\";a:3:{s:6:\"amount\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"edit_beneficiary\";b:1;s:18:\"convenience_charge\";s:0:\"\";}}','[{\"code\":false}]','api-testing-timeout-failure','10','10000',NULL,'2024-08-14 12:13:47','2018-08-17T11:43:36+00:00','2024-08-12T05:56:49+00:00',121,0,'api-testing-timeout-failure'),(91,338,'testsuccess001','[]','API TESTING - Timeout Success','API TESTING - Timeout Sucess','{\"price\":\"RANGE\",\"type\":\"RANGE\",\"min\":\"10\",\"max\":\"10000\",\"denominations\":[\"10\",\"100\",\"1000\",\"2000\",\"3000\",\"4000\",\"5000\",\"6000\",\"7000\",\"8000\",\"9000\",\"10000\"],\"currency\":{\"code\":\"INR\",\"symbol\":\"\\u20b9\",\"numericCode\":\"356\"},\"cpg\":[]}',0,NULL,'{\"price\":\"RANGE\",\"type\":\"RANGE\",\"min\":\"10\",\"max\":\"10000\",\"denominations\":[\"10\",\"100\",\"1000\",\"2000\",\"3000\",\"4